#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:6
msgid "TrainingSet"
msgstr "学習データ集合"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:8
msgid ""
"`GlobalSurrogateManager`/`LocalSurrogateManager`/`PairwiseSurrogateManager`"
" delegate building the training data to `TrainingSet`, a swappable "
"component. Pass it via the `training_set` argument."
msgstr "`GlobalSurrogateManager`/`LocalSurrogateManager`/`PairwiseSurrogateManager`は、交換可能なコンポーネントである`TrainingSet`に学習データの構築を委譲します。`training_set`引数で渡します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:11
msgid "TrainingSet's role"
msgstr "TrainingSetの役割"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:13
msgid ""
"`TrainingSet` requires only one method, `build(archive, population, ctx, "
"candidate_x=None) -> TrainingData`, to be implemented. `candidate_x` is "
"an argument `LocalSurrogateManager` passes as the k-NN query center per "
"candidate; `GlobalSurrogateManager` calls it with `None`."
msgstr ""
"`TrainingSet`が実装する必要があるメソッドは`build(archive, population, ctx, "
"candidate_x=None) -> "
"TrainingData`の1つだけです。`candidate_x`は、`LocalSurrogateManager`が候補ごとのk-"
"NN検索中心として渡す引数です。`GlobalSurrogateManager`は`None`を渡して呼び出します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:16
msgid ""
"`TrainingData` is a dataclass holding `train_x` (normally shape "
"`(n_train, dim)`; only `PairwiseComparisonSet` uses `(n_train, 2*dim)`) "
"and `train_y` (`(n_train, n_obj)` for regression, `(n_train,)` for "
"classification or ranking)."
msgstr ""
"`TrainingData`は、`train_x`（通常は形状`(n_train, "
"dim)`で、`PairwiseComparisonSet`だけが`(n_train, 2*dim)`を使います）と、回帰では`(n_train,"
" n_obj)`、分類またはランキングでは`(n_train,)`となる`train_y`を保持するデータクラスです。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:18
msgid "The 8 built-in classes are organized along two orthogonal axes."
msgstr "組み込みの8クラスは、直交する2つの軸に沿って整理されています。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:20
msgid ""
"**Data-source axis**: Where training data is drawn from — archive / "
"population / k nearest neighbors / pairs / reference point"
msgstr "**データソース軸**：学習データの取得元 — アーカイブ / 個体群 / k近傍 / ペア / 参照点"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:21
msgid ""
"**Labeling axis**: How values are assigned — raw objective value "
"(regression) / binary classification / multi-level ranking / pairwise "
"comparison"
msgstr "**ラベル付け軸**：値の割り当て方 — 生の目的値（回帰） / 二値分類 / 多段階ランキング / ペア比較"

