#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid ""
"Uses the entire archive with raw objective values. "
"`GlobalSurrogateManager`'s default"
msgstr "アーカイブ全体を生の目的値とともに使います。`GlobalSurrogateManager`の既定値です。"

