msgstr "`ConstraintObjectiveSet`のk-NN版"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "`FeasibilityClassificationSet`"
msgstr "`FeasibilityClassificationSet`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "`source=\"archive\"`"
msgstr "`source=\"archive\"`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "Binary classification labels via `cv <= eps_cv`"
msgstr "による二値分類ラベル `cv <= eps_cv`。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "`source=\"archive\", top_ratio=0.5`"
msgstr "`source=\"archive\", top_ratio=0.5`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid ""
"After sorting, labels the top `floor(n * top_ratio)` as label=1 and the "
"rest as label=0"
msgstr "ソート後、上位`floor(n * top_ratio)`件にlabel=1、残りにlabel=0を付けます。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "`source=\"population\", n_levels=5`"
msgstr "`source=\"population\", n_levels=5`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid ""
"After sorting, assigns multi-level labels across `n_levels` equally "
"divided groups"
msgstr "ソート後、`n_levels`個の等分されたグループに複数レベルのラベルを割り当てます。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "`source=\"archive\", n_pairs=None, rng=None`"
msgstr "`source=\"archive\", n_pairs=None, rng=None`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "Pairs up two points and labels the win/loss of their comparison"
msgstr "2点をペアにし、比較の勝敗をラベル付けします"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "`ref_source=\"population_best\"`"
msgstr "`ref_source=\"population_best\"`"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md
msgid "A binary label for whether an archive point dominates a reference point"
msgstr "アーカイブ上の点が参照点を支配するかどうかの二値ラベル。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:48
msgid ""
"`ConstraintObjectiveSet`/`KNNConstraintObjectiveSet` raise `ValueError` "
"if the problem has no constraints (`archive.g` has 0 columns)."
msgstr "`ConstraintObjectiveSet`/`KNNConstraintObjectiveSet`は、問題に制約がない場合（`archive.g`の列数が0）に`ValueError`を送出します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:50
msgid ""
"The `eps_cv` used for `FeasibilityClassificationSet`'s feasibility "
"judgment is obtained from `ctx.problem.eps_cv`, falling back to `1e-6` "
"when `ctx=None`."
msgstr "`FeasibilityClassificationSet`の実行可能性判定に使う`eps_cv`は`ctx.problem.eps_cv`から取得し、`ctx=None`の場合は`1e-6`にフォールバックします。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:52
msgid ""
"Classes with a `source` argument "
"(`FeasibilityClassificationSet`/`TopKBipartitionSet`/`LevelBasedSet`/`PairwiseComparisonSet`)"
" all share the behavior of raising `ValueError` if "
"`source=\"population\"` is specified while `population=None`."
msgstr "`source`引数を持つクラス（`FeasibilityClassificationSet`/`TopKBipartitionSet`/`LevelBasedSet`/`PairwiseComparisonSet`）は、`source=\"population\"`を指定したときに`population=None`であれば、いずれも`ValueError`を送出します。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:54
msgid ""
"`PairwiseComparisonSet` builds an array of shape `(n_pairs, 2*dim)` by "
"concatenating `train_x = [x_a, x_b]` for each pair `(a, b)`, labeling it "
"`1` if `comparator.compare(f_a, cv_a, f_b, cv_b) <= 0` (a beats or ties "
"b), and `0` otherwise. If `n_pairs=None`, every pair, `n*(n-1)/2` of "
"them, is used."
msgstr ""
"`PairwiseComparisonSet`は、各ペア`(a, b)`について`train_x = [x_a, "
"x_b]`を連結し、形状`(n_pairs, 2*dim)`の配列を構築します。`comparator.compare(f_a, cv_a, "
"f_b, cv_b) <= "
"0`（aがbに勝つか同点）の場合は`1`、それ以外は`0`とラベル付けします。`n_pairs=None`の場合は、すべてのペア`n*(n-1)/2`個を使います。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:58
msgid ""
"`PairwiseComparisonSet`'s `train_x` has the special shape `(n_pairs, "
"2*dim)`, incompatible in shape with a standard regression surrogate such "
"as `RBFSurrogate`. It needs to be paired with a dedicated pairwise-"
"comparison surrogate from the [ComparisonSurrogate](surrogate.md) family."
msgstr ""
"`PairwiseComparisonSet`の`train_x`は`(n_pairs, "
"2*dim)`という特殊な形状であり、`RBFSurrogate`のような標準的な回帰サロゲートとは形状が非互換です。 "
"[ComparisonSurrogate](surrogate.md)系のペア比較専用サロゲートと組み合わせる必要があります。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:62
msgid ""
"Unlike `PairwiseComparisonSet`, `ReferencePointComparisonSet`'s `train_x`"
" is only `(n_archive, dim)`, so it's compatible with "
"`GlobalSurrogateManager`/`LocalSurrogateManager`."
msgstr ""
"`PairwiseComparisonSet`と異なり、`ReferencePointComparisonSet`の`train_x`は`(n_archive,"
" dim)`だけなので、`GlobalSurrogateManager`/`LocalSurrogateManager`と互換性があります。"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:64
msgid "Implementing a custom TrainingSet"
msgstr "独自TrainingSetの実装方法"

#: ../../concepts/surrogate_modeling/training_set.md:66
msgid ""
"If you need a custom training-data extraction scheme, subclass "
"`TrainingSet` and implement only `build()`. The following example is an "
"implementation that uses only the most recently added `k` entries as "
"training data."
msgstr "独自の学習データ抽出方式が必要な場合は、`TrainingSet`をサブクラス化し、`build()`だけを実装します。次の例は、直近に追加された`k`件だけを学習データとして使う実装です。"

